Case 2: JSON_OBJECTAGG keeps the first value of a duplicate key; result = no_hash_aggregate     

===================================================
g    json_objectagg('k', j)    
1     {"k":"x"}     
2     {"k":"w"}     

===================================================
g    json_objectagg('k', j)    
1     {"k":"x"}     
2     {"k":"w"}     

===================================================
    
Case 3: MAX and MIN of equal strings under utf8_en_ci; result = no_hash_aggregate     

===================================================
g    max(s)    min(s)    
1     a     a     
2     q     q     

===================================================
g    max(s)    min(s)    
1     a     a     
2     q     q     

